<p>-1.</p>
<p>I guess it's kinda a neat subversion of the traditional Series 1 spooky monsters, but it's perhaps a little too subtle. There's no pathos or emotional engagement with the skeleton because there's something thoroughly unhuman about its actions, even when it displays empathy, interest or positive behaviours.</p>
